OL,3,GNEWSANew #4m football stadium set for
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club is set to return to its
OL,7,Fformer home after more than 40 years
OL,8,Fwith a new #4m stadium.
OL,10,FCouncillors in Great Yarmouth are
OL,11,Fexpected to back plans for Gorleston FC
OL,12,Fto build the new ground on the
OL,13,FRecreation Ground in Church Lane next
OL,14,Fweek.
OL,16,FThe club's plans include a full-sized
OL,17,Fall-weather pitch, floodlights and
OL,18,Fclubhouse with changing facilities, bar
OL,19,Fand cafe.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
