OL,3,GNEWSANew #4m football stadium set for
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been some opposition to the
OL,7,Fidea though, with concerns including
OL,8,Fnoise, parking and the loss of land
OL,9,Fwhich is currently a recreation ground
OL,10,Ffor the wider community.
